  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to _______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "28",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>15</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Now using,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>30</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>15</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>15</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Now comparing with given value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
